Subject: snow spray, falling snow and snow curtains in one draw each
 (ETR_GL_PARTICLES, ETR_GL_SNOW)

Particles: the quads of all particles in one array with a colour for each vertex. Flakes: those between the side planes in one array, moved and turned by CPU. Curtains: all squares in one array. The curtains were drawn twice in a frame with the same vertices (UpdateSnow, then DrawSnow); the second draw fails the depth test everywhere and is left out.

